            {
              "id": "israel_related_context",
              "label": "Israel-related expression in context",
              "description": "Assess relevant IHRA examples in overall context, including anti-Jewish tropes, discriminatory standards or denial of Jewish self-determination. Do not assume that policy criticism alone satisfies a criterion.",
